{"availability":"available","full":"GiantAILab/YingMusic-Singer","name":"YingMusic-Singer","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":77,"forks":10,"created":"2025-11-26T04:17:13Z","updated":"2026-04-28T02:20:04Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://giantailab.github.io/YingMusic-Singer-demo/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.497Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.497Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.497Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.497Z","stars":77,"forks":10}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Note: The beta version is deprecated. If you need to use it, please switch to the beta branch.","YingMusic-Singer is a unified framework for Zero-shot Singing Voice Synthesis (SVS) and Editing, driven by Annotation-free Melody Guidance. Addressing the scalability challenges of real-world applications, our system eliminates the reliance on costly phoneme-level alignment and manual melody annotations. It enables arbitrary lyrics to be synthesized or edited with any reference melody in a zero-shot manner."],"features":["Unified Synthesis & Editing: Seamlessly integrates zero-shot synthesis and editing within a single framework.","Annotation-free Melody Guidance: Automatically extracts melody from reference audio, eliminating the need for manual MIDI or phoneme alignment.","Zero-Shot Capabilities: Generates high-quality singing voices from arbitrary lyrics and melodies without fine-tuning on the target voice.","Flexible Melody Input: Accepts both reference audio and direct MIDI files as melody inputs for enhanced versatility."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GiantAILab/YingMusic-Singer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"49f893cc4d4d0a9dfc13792ad7be941d7a94aef175a0703f7ab6edf8da0ef496","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.578Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.578Z","projectInsights":{"